# GymAxis — Production Docker Bundle Exclusions (Iter 220be / F-30)
#
# Anything matched here is excluded from the Docker build context AND
# any subsequent COPY commands. Mirrors the runtime-secret hygiene rules
# from `.gitignore` so dev-only artefacts (test credentials, internal
# memory files, security audit documents) never ship to a production
# image.
#
# Defence-in-depth — `.gitignore` already keeps the truly sensitive
# files out of source control, but a deployment platform that builds
# from the working tree rather than `git archive` would otherwise pick
# them up. This file is the safety net.

# ── Memory / scratch / dev knowledge base ────────────────────────────
# /memory contains design notes, PRD, security audit, legal templates,
# operator runbooks, pen-test handover docs. None of it is referenced
# at runtime by the backend or frontend and shipping it to prod would
# leak operational detail to anyone who pops a shell in the container.
memory/
memory/**
/app/memory/
/app/memory/**

# ── Hard rule: never ship the test-credentials file ─────────────────
# Already in `.gitignore` but listed explicitly so an audit tool can
# see the intent without traversing `.gitignore`'s shape.
**/test_credentials.md
test_credentials.md

# ── Pytest / coverage artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*
backend/tests/
backend/.pytest_cache/

# ── IDE / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Front-end build leftovers (production image rebuilds these) ────
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.cache/
frontend/build/
frontend/dist/

# ── Local-only env files / supervisor logs ─────────────────────────
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test
.env.test.local
*.env.local
backend/.env.local
frontend/.env.local
*.log
logs/

# ── Git + platform metadata ────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

# ── Misc dev files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
README.md
SECURITY.md
CHANGELOG.md
ROADMAP.md
Makefile
*.test.md
test_reports/
